{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0174gkwPNpSxgUoqfBDYk6tH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted results for each planned experiment in the experiment plan, under the \"best\" tier scenario. I need to produce a YAML block with imagined experiments, each with expected results, rationale, tables, figures, and analysis.\n\nLet me carefully go through each planned experiment and generate predictions consistent with the \"best\" tier definition.\n\nThe best tier says:\n- FOLIO +6.7pp holds or expands on ~100 questions\n- ProofWriter shows positive gap ≥1pp\n- K ablation shows even K → more ties → more SICA gain, odd K gain disappears\n\n\n- 7B model C0 exceeds 60% with SICA-SC gap larger than 14B's, combined gap ranging 3.0-5.5pp across benchmarks, FOLIO gap 5.0-8.0pp, ProofWriter gap 1.0-3.0pp, and bootstrap p-values between 0.01-0.05 for combined results\n- 14B C0 baseline 0.45-0.6, 7B C0 baseline 0.6-0.75, QwQ C0 near zero at 0.0-0.05, with 7B SICA gap 4.0-8.0pp and tiebreak win rate 0.7-0.85\n- K ablation shows strong correlation of 0.7-0.95, and I'm planning nine experiments: expanding SICA to 200+ questions, testing K sensitivity, comparing tiebreak strategies, scaling to 7B and 72B models, validating C0 diagnostics, and conducting qualitative case studies on constraint quality\n\n. Exp-005 with QwQ-32B is already complete, so I'll note that and move forward with detailed predictions for the remaining ones, including overhead analysis for wall-time breakdown.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11013,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11013},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_u